    "body": "Per-merge check (our boxes, `cargo xtask gate quick --base <merge>^1` on each first-parent merge): all seven merges of the 19:12-19:15 batch came back **green** - #3222, #3223, #3120, #3112, #3080, #3167 (2899 s), #3204 (1367 s). So neither failing test (`guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path`, `machines_pane::the_sheet_states_rigid_tapping_in_words`) was reached by any single merge's quick selection: the break is either a combination of two merges, or in a ui lib test that the touched-file map does not pick for the merge that broke it. Bisect with the full `camcraft-ui --lib` on each merge, not quick.",
